---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

export const prerender = true;

const updated = "September 2026";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy — Shovin Jeson Dsouza"
  description="What this site collects (almost nothing), and what happens to a message you send through the contact form."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="panel">
      <span class="corner tl"></span>
      <span class="corner tr"></span>
      <span class="corner bl"></span>
      <span class="corner br"></span>
      <span class="panel-label">~/privacy</span>

      <h1 class="page-title">privacy</h1>
      <p class="updated">last updated: {updated}</p>

      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          This is a personal portfolio site. It's intentionally simple, and it
          collects as little as possible.
        </p>

        <h2>What's collected</h2>
        <p>
          There are no accounts, no advertising cookies, and no cross-site
          tracking. Nothing about you is stored in a database.
        </p>
        <p>
          Page views are counted with
          <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Cloudflare Web Analytics</a>,
          which sets no cookies, reads nothing out of your browser's storage,
          and does not fingerprint you or follow you to other sites. What I get
          is a count: which pages were opened, roughly which country from, and
          which site linked here. None of it identifies anyone.
        </p>
        <p>
          The one exception is the contact form. When you send a message, the
          name, email address, and message you typed are passed to
          <a href="https://resend.com/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Resend</a>,
          the service that delivers it, and the email lands in my personal
          inbox. Nothing is written to a database here or kept on the site. I
          keep those emails as long as the conversation is useful, and you can
          ask me to delete one at any time.
        </p>
        <p>
          Switching the site between dark and light saves that one choice in your
          browser's local storage, under <code>theme</code>. It stays on your
          device, is never sent here, and holds nothing but the word
          <code>dark</code> or <code>light</code>. Clearing your site data
          forgets it and the site goes back to following your system setting.
        </p>
        <p>
          Sending a message also sets one cookie, <code>shovin_contact_at</code>,
          which holds nothing but the time you sent it. It exists so the form
          can't be hammered, expires after a minute, and never leaves this site.
        </p>
        <p>
          The form is the only place the site asks you for anything. Everything
          else on it is read-only.
        </p>

        <h2>Hosting</h2>
        <p>
          Like any website, the host may keep standard server logs (IP address,
          browser type, pages requested) for security and operational reasons.
          These are not used to identify or profile you.
        </p>

        <h2>External links</h2>
        <p>
          Links out to GitHub, LinkedIn, Discord, and project demos lead to
          third-party services with their own privacy policies. This site isn't
          responsible for how they handle your data.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about this page? Reach me at
          <a href="mailto:shovindsouza27@gmail.com">shovindsouza27@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero { padding: 32px 0; }

  .page-title {
    font-family: var(--font-pixel);
    font-size: var(--fs-title);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--accent);
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }
  .updated {
    font-size: var(--fs-meta);
    color: var(--text-dim);
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .prose { margin-top: 28px; max-width: var(--measure); }
  .prose h2 {
    font-size: var(--fs-body);
    color: var(--text);
    margin-top: 28px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .prose p {
    font-size: var(--fs-body);
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }
  .prose a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
    transition: border-color 0.15s;
  }
  .prose a:hover { border-bottom-color: var(--accent); }
  .prose code {
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: var(--fs-meta);
    color: var(--amber);
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
</style>
